\pard\tx720\tx1440\b\fs32\cf2 \uc0\u9888\u65039  H\u432 \u7899 ng D\u7855 n M\u7903  Kh\u243 a AuraTube (Khi G\u7863 p L\u7895 i B\u7843 o M\u7853 t)\b0\fs24\cf3 \
\
Do AuraTube l\u224  \u7873 ng d\u7905 ng m\u227  ngu\u7891 n m\u7873  ch\u432 a mua ch\u7913 ng ch\u7881  Apple tr\u7843  ph\u237 , tr\u234 n macOS (Sonoma, Sequoia...) c\u243  th\u7875  hi\u7875 n th\u243 ng b\u225 o ch\u7863 n m\u7903  ho\u7863 c b\u225 o "App b\u7883  h\u7887 ng".\
\
B\u7841 n c\u243  th\u7875  m\u7903  kh\u243 a c\u7921 c k\u7923  d\u7875  d\u224 ng b\u7851 ng 1 trong 2 c\u225 ch sau:\
\
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\
\b\fs26\cf3 C\u193 CH 1: KH\u212 NG C\u7846 N G\u213  L\u7878 NH (CHU\u7848 N MAC, NHANH NH\u7844 T)\b0\fs24 \
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\
1. K\u233 o \b AuraTube.app\b0  v\u224 o th\u432  m\u7905 c \b Applications\b0 .\
2. M\u7903  Finder, v\u224 o th\u432  m\u7905 c \b Applications\b0 .\
3. Nh\u7845 p \b CHU\u7894 T PH\u7842 I\b0  (ho\u7843 c gi\u7913  ph\u237 m \b Control\b0  r\u7891 i b\u7845 m) v\u224 o \b AuraTube\b0 .\
4. Ch\u7885 n \b "Open" (M\u7903 )\b0  -> B\u7845 m ti\u7875 p \b "Open"\b0  \u7853  h\u7897 p tho\u7841 i x\u225 c nh\u7853 n.\
\cf4 *(macOS s\u7869  ghi nh\u7899  quy\u7873 n v\u297 nh vi\u7875 n, t\u7913  l\u7847 n sau b\u7841 n ch\u7881  c\u7847 n b\u7845 m m\u7903  b\u236 nh th\u432 \u7895 ng)*\cf3 \
\
\b * Ri\u234 ng macOS Sequoia (15+):\b0 \
V\u224 o \b C\u224 i \u273 \u7863 t h\u7875  th\u7889 ng (System Settings)\b0  -> \b Quy\u7873 n ri\u234 ng t\u432  & B\u7843 o m\u7853 t (Privacy & Security)\b0  -> Cu\u7891 n xu\u7889 ng d\u432 \u7899 i c\u249 ng v\u224  b\u7845 m \b "V\u7855 n m\u7903 " (Open Anyway)\b0 .\
\
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\
\b\fs26\cf3 C\u193 CH 2: D\u249 NG 1 D\u212 NG L\u7878 NH TERMINAL\b0\fs24 \
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\
1. Nh\u7845 n \b Command + Space\b0 , g\u245  \b Terminal\b0  v\u224  nh\u7845 n Enter \u273 \u7875  m\u7903  Terminal.\
2. Sao ch\u233 p v\u224  d\u225 n d\u242 ng l\u7878 nh sau r\u7891 i nh\u7845 n Enter:\
\
    \b xattr -cr /Applications/AuraTube.app\b0 \
\
3. M\u7903  AuraTube v\u224  th\u432 \u7895 ng th\u7913 c!\
}
